S131 LRC14 FAREY-BIPARTITE OBSTRUCTION LEDGER
==============================================================================
[Assumption challenge]
  considered vertices: fractions, bipartition sides, incidence edges,
    K3,3 minors, LRC rows, residues, wall crossings, and proof ledgers.
  chosen quotient: M(S)=p/q -> K_{p,q}, while retaining excess e=14p-q.
  preserved predicate: product-side incidence depth of a Farey escape.
  destroyed information: exact safe-time intervals and row-specific geometry.

